.TH "libnvmf_tid_is_empty" 9 "libnvmf_tid_is_empty" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_tid_is_empty \- Test whether a TID sets no fields.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "bool" libnvmf_tid_is_empty
.BI "(const struct libnvmf_tid *tid "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "tid" 12
The transport ID, or NULL.
.SH "RETURN"
true if \fItid\fP is NULL or every field is unset, false otherwise.
